rnnoise (0~git20250428.d8ea2b0+ppa2~resolute1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Drop the unanchored "build" tar-ignore pattern, which would strip any
    nested build directory from the source tarball. Harmless in this tree,
    which has none, but it broke telegram-desktop outright.
  * Test-build the extracted source package rather than the working-tree
    copy, so this class of packaging defect is caught before upload.

 -- Stanislav Aleksandrov <lightofmysoul@gmail.com>  Sat, 01 Aug 2026 22:30:00 +0000

